# Lidya - "Talk" interaction.
# Entry point is the top of the file (no label given in talk.tres).

if not flag("met_lidya")
	=> first_meeting
if girl.affection >= 10
	=> close
=> casual

~ first_meeting
do set_flag("met_lidya")
Lidya: Oh! You must be the new manager.
Lidya: I'm Lidya. I handle the reports around here.
- Nice to meet you, Lidya.
	Lidya: Likewise! I hope we'll work well together.
	do add_stat("affection", 1)
- Reports? Show me later.
	Lidya: ...Sure. Later.
Lidya: I should get back to work.

~ casual
Lidya: Hey, {player.display_name}. Need something?
- How is work going?
	Lidya: Busy, as always. But I'm managing.
- You look tired. [if girl.energy < 50]
	Lidya: Is it that obvious? I'll grab a coffee.
	do add_stat("energy", 10)
- Just checking on you.
	Lidya: That's sweet of you.
	do add_stat("affection", 1)
- Nothing, never mind. => END

~ close
Lidya: There you are! I was hoping you'd stop by.
Lidya: Affection is at {girl.affection}. Placeholder for the higher-affection branch.
